00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:25.100
Yoo-hoo. Are you awake now?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:34.800
Not A Curse

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.440
"Not A Curse."

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.810
Looks like you've returned, Kanami.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:43.100
You're not surprised, and you're acting distant.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.650
To be frank, I want to
distance myself from you, so...

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:56.190
I see. So Elias Hackblade
has been traveling with you.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:00.480
That's right! And then
we fought Geniuses and won!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.480
We are champions!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.940
It's been a while since I last saw you.
Did you become kinda relaxed?

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.100
To me, you used to appear as
if you were restraining yourself

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.230
so that you wouldn't cause others trouble.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:19.980
I would say that's not too far off.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:25.940
I was an unwanted child,
born from my father's affair.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.440
In order to live in that house,

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.940
I had no choice but to be
inconspicuous and behave myself.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:41.230
I appear relaxed now because
I don't have to go back to that house.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:45.310
Anyway, what're you doing
in a place like this, Krus?

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.600
I got caught in an accident.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.560
Thanks to that, I was given
a negative status, too.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.770
Who gave it to you?

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.440
Who?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:03.060
Come to think of it, who gave me the curse?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.060
Who did I lose against?

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:15.270
When the rocks were falling,
I saw Lord Elias in the direction of the sky.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.400
Yeah.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.230
He kinda didn't look like his usual self.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.900
Calm down. What happened?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.230
Is that from the recon team?

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:31.730
Well...

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.060
It was a raid enemy.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:38.560
The Crimson King Faction guys were
all defeated and sent to the Cathedral.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:45.600
A raid enemy? I've never
heard of one being around here.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:48.020
What the hell's going on?

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:55.310
Zone E, Sirius Grotto

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:58.020
How terrible... I wonder
if the Master Immortal is okay.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:24.650
What a coincidence,
running into you in a place like this.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.650
Master Immortal!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.400
Nue - Half-raid Ranked

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.190
It's... a Nue.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.020
Tiger Echo Fist!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:52.770
That's the adventurous Eured Continent for you!

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:55.150
Go hide, Hua Diao.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.980
Okay!

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:00.350
A half-raid ranked monster, huh?

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:03.850
Normally, it's an enemy that 12
Adventurers with appropriate levels

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:06.060
should fight together.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.730
Is that gonna be a wide-range attack?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.900
As it stands, we have no chance.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:27.900
I wonder if he's the raid boss here.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.730
It came from the sky.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:34.480
An overview of summoning spells
was sent to Kunlun,

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:39.730
which made it possible for troops to
be sent to places based on the resources.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:43.980
Our witch-ruler Queen Mother of the West

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:47.230
is rushing the clock hands.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:51.060
She says there is no one qualified in this land.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:57.850
Swaying in her doze on
the shattered rainbow beach,

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.690
she dreams of returning.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.560
She bids to send down the time-release beasts

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:08.230
that Colopatiron releases one
after another just like meteors.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.400
My new fellow comrade, Elias.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:19.100
Accept the demand by our
Queen Mother of the West and

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.810
put an end to your obsession!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.480
Eli-Eli!

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:35.690
Youren said the magical beast came from the sky.

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:40.480
She also said it's now possible
to send troops to places.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.770
It's a declaration of invasion.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.310
Which means...

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.230
...she's an enemy.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.940
What they're saying is
so difficult I don't understand.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:57.190
Yeah. What the heck is Colo-colo-pan--

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:59.190
What do they mean?

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:03.190
Colopatiron... I might be a Genius's name...

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:07.150
And "time-release" means eliminating flags?

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.150
It'll be like, once you leave the first town,

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:14.560
you'll already see a whole bunch of
final boss level monsters lined up for you?

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:18.900
No way. I don't think it's possible, but...

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.190
Aura Saber!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.270
I've learned from defeat...

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.520
...that this is not "collecting," but "hunting."

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:37.060
You will all die by your own sword.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:42.980
Kanami!

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.480
Frognardo!

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.730
What happened to Elias?

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:52.940
Abnormalities are detected
in Lord Elias's pulse and iris.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.900
Do you wish to be healed?

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:04.270
This... curse...!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.730
Move back!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.400
If possible, stay away!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:20.100
There are things we can
only discuss man to man...

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.770
...right?!

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:30.100
He's strong.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:35.650
After all, you must be strong, Elias!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:39.690
You were famous among us Adventurers.

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:42.270
I fought together with you many times.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:45.310
I gave a shout of victory with you, too.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.270
To us, you are a hero!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.980
What hero?! Do not make me laugh!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.730
Because of the fairy curse, I cannot...!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.200
Leonardo

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.200
Human

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.200
Assassin

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.200
Affiliated Guild

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.200
None

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:03.200
Assassin

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:03.200
Affiliated Guild

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:03.200
None

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:03.600
Elias can't reduce his opponent's
HP to less than 25 percent.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:07.020
That's why Kanami kept running
around without attacking him.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.710
Leonardo

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.710
Human

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.710
Assassin

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.020
The curse that binds me...!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:18.600
If it is for tearing off these chains,

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.810
I will take any kind of suffering!

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:25.770
Fine then. Why don't you do it?!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.480
I'll be the villain!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.190
Villain?

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.810
It means he'll be the bad guy for Elias's sake!

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:46.520
What passion! You're so passionate, frog guy!

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.270
Could you sit down?

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.270
Why are they beating each other
when they are friends?

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:53.480
Is this that "talking with fists" thing?

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.150
I know what this is about, my lord.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.560
What?

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:02.270
This is the power of masculinity... yeah.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:04.050
Power of masculinity

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:03.940
Huh?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.350
What the hell's going on?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:16.150
Hey, Chung Lu! Report on the situation!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:20.270
Well... I don't know where to start.

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:24.940
In any case, please hurry to Zone E,
which is in the back of Sirius Grotto.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.080
Zone E, Sirius Grotto

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:32.440
This Fresh Blood Demon Ax
has the HP absorption effect.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:37.520
To increase the HP recovery ability,

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:41.090
I need to increase the damage
I inflict on my opponent.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.730
But...

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.090
HP's natural recovery becomes suspended.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.090
HP recovery by healing spells, facilities,

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.090
or items becomes impossible.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.090
Telepathic links become suspended.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:51.810
This two-handed weapon
with high attack power can be useful,

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.560
but it has its limits.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:58.980
Krusty

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:58.980
Human

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:58.980
Guardian

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:59.020
Her attacks have the HP absorption effect, too.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:02.990
Enchantress Youren

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:03.350
So she can use that to heal
the damage I inflict on her.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:04.560
Then...!

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:13.560
Shredding Reminiscences, Mnemosyne's Taboo.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:17.270
By offering my memories,
I'll turn them into energy.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:23.060
In return for MP recovery and enchantment,

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.630
Krusty

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.630
Human

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.630
Guardian

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:25.350
he let go of his own memories?!

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.190
Milord wields his ax! His foe is only

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:31.850
surprised by the large amount
of damage she received!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.940
What is this shock?!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.850
It's just one of the sideshows.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:43.020
I don't have to worry about running out of MP.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:45.560
I've got plenty of fuel.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.160
Guardian

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:51.160
Enchantress Youren

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:51.480
Why...? How...?!

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.600
Master Immortal!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:26.230
The world is full of the
difficult problems you seek out.

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:31.600
The tasks you take on are easy
because you don't seek treasure.

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:38.690
I think the people around you will be
happy if you became a bit greedier.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:44.400
A talented person should be
greedy to a certain extent.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:47.020
Right, milord?

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.100
Please stay back.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.770
Ah... O-Okay!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.310
I expect nothing less from an Adventurer

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.100
whom the Supreme Deity
and Queen Mother favor

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:04.650
although you probably do not remember it.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:10.480
A Witch Genius,
Bucaphi with tiger fangs, was it?

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.850
This cannot be right!
You got your memories back?!

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.900
The curse... What happened to the spell?!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.350
It's not that it was removed.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:25.510
or items becomes impossible.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:25.510
Telepathic links become suspended.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:25.510
It is impossible to move across the server.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:25.510
Memories become lost.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:25.130
But there's no statement that you're
not allowed to take the lost memories back.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.510
However, regaining memories is possible.

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:34.400
That time...

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:39.810
I ended up in Kunlun,
an isolated island on the rainbow ocean.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:49.020
Bucaphi wanted me to be
her vassal and I refused.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:51.980
Then...

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:56.230
I was given a negative status and tossed away.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:14:59.960
Zhu Huan, Lelang Wolf Cavalry

00:14:59.000 --> 00:14:59.960
Guild Master

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.460
Gumon

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.690
Even if I regain the memories
and connections with others,

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.770
the benefit gained from it isn't much.

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:18.390
Even so, I don't enjoy
offering part of my memories.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:24.150
Papus... That's your true name.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:23.650
Healing Genius

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:23.650
Papus, Genius

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:29.520
I gave in, thinking I couldn't
run from a boring life.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:35.020
But I once saw a noble-minded person
who refused to give up on her wishes.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:46.190
I was able to find enemies...
something that lets me forget boredom.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:51.270
Come to think of it, Shiroe
and the others might've been trying

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:54.730
to make their mark on this land.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.690
D.D.D is a comfortable place for me.

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:01.270
It probably is my treasure.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:05.900
I don't intend to let it be taken away.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.980
"If you're not upset when
something is taken away"...

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.150
I'm going back to Yamato.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.600
But it'll only be...

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.850
...after I defeat you guys.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.850
Its tail sensor showed a reaction again, Master.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.980
Is this what Shiro
would call "hostility control"?

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:31.650
Rear guards! Hinder its motion
to prevent its wide-range attack!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.230
Advance guards! Surround it
and rapidly reduce its HP!

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.400
Yeah!

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.350
Um... Who's that kitty?

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:44.600
He's Zhu Huan, our Guild Master.
We met up right before we got here.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.690
All right then! We'll beat Nue first!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:52.850
Then we'll go get Frognardo and Eli-Eli!
And while we're at it, Krus, too!

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:54.600
--Yes, Master.
--Roger that!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.570
Krusty

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.570
Human

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.570
Guardian

