00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.190
I've told Krusty about it in the past.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:17.020
The contract document needs
to be created just for its purpose.

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:21.400
It requires rare materials
based on the scale of the wish.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.520
To make the wish come true,
it requires you to pay a price.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.060
Contractor:

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.060
Log Horizon Guild Master:

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.520
Furthermore, to make it effective,

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.850
concerned parties need to agree and sign.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:36.650
For the Soul Darkness Curse, no price
was paid nor was there an agreement.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.980
Because of that, the effectiveness
of the contract is quite limited.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:44.440
I degenerated Elias and apprehended you.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.810
I'm sure I had the victory in my hand!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:49.650
I wasn't apprehended.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.520
I was just resting.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:56.020
As for Elias, he probably just lost his way.

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.230
You lie--

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:04.270
My condolences!

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.520
Finish him! Shower attacks on it!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.560
Bam! Bang! Ka-pow!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.830
Leonardo

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.830
Human

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.830
Assassin

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:22.980
Hey, Hero.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.830
Affiliated Guild

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.830
None

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:27.330
Elias Hackblade

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:27.330
Elf

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:27.330
Blademancer

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:27.330
Affiliated Guild

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:27.330
Knights of the Red 
Branch

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:26.020
When'd you come back to your senses?

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.770
How was that?!

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:40.730
"How was that"?

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:43.270
That was a pathetic punch.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.230
It was amateurish.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:49.520
Hmph! The fairy curse
is already lifted, isn't it?

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.310
That is not true!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:58.270
You reduced my HP to under 25 percent.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.900
It took too long.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:03.730
I cannot achieve anything
with that kind of power.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:06.190
Do you want to kill someone?

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:12.480
Is that why you wanna get rid of
the curse that makes you unable to kill?

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.980
What?

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:18.690
No... I want to protect my comrades.

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.060
That is why...

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:24.480
Is that fairy curse really a curse?

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:28.900
It is not a curse?

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:33.350
We, your fans, don't call it a curse.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:37.060
It was said to be a
crystallization of your pledge.

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:38.440
My pledge?

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:42.560
Elias. It's not that you can't kill.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.730
You don't wanna kill.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.060
You were like that in the game, too.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:53.480
Even when you could've gotten out of
a pinch by killing your enemy, you didn't.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:56.770
Because of that, you let them
get away or got captured by them.

00:19:56.770 --> 00:20:01.770
But even so, you didn't kill
because you didn't wanna kill.

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:07.060
Not just monsters. People of the Land,
Adventurers, and the Ancients...

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:11.600
No matter who you were fighting,
you made a vow not to kill.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:17.690
I know that because we've
read the story about you thoroughly.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.270
More than you.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:23.770
So, I root for you.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:26.350
What you have is a pledge.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:29.900
Don't hate yourself by calling it a curse.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.690
How did his curse get removed?

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:38.100
Same way Krusty's did.

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:43.730
He changed his rules by passing
the breaking point on his own will.

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.770
After meeting up, milord and the others arrived

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:50.650
at the old broadcast station site
in Sirius Grotto's deepest spot.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:58.440
You have proven the power of
ruling this land. I am quite satisfied.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:01.190
I hereby acknowledge your coronation

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:05.350
and promote you to lost shepherd.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:08.440
Madam Queen Mother of the West...?

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:12.060
I'm much obliged to you
for your prompt greeting!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.600
The boss Genius, huh?

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:20.770
The one Krusty met in Kunlun?

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:23.980
My lord. Where's Kunlun?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.480
It's probably...

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:27.560
...on the moon.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:32.190
Thus, milord and the others
continue their journey to Yamato.

