00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:35.060
The end

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:34.940
And they all lived happily ever after.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:42.440
Shiroe. Did you figure out
what Krusty wanted to tell you?

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:43.650
As long as they realize it,

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:48.100
non-Adventurers can change
the rules in this world.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:50.100
Or...

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:55.150
...that there's a possibility
Geniuses use the Elder Tales' system.

00:21:55.150 --> 00:22:00.100
What's for sure is that Krusty is planning
to go to the moon to fight Geniuses.

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:03.600
Hold on a second, please!

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.730
Going to the moon to fight?
Something like that...!

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:08.690
Of course he will do it.

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:10.270
He probably will.

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:13.060
Then when will he be back in Yamato?

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:15.400
It's milord we're talking about.
While he's at it,

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.350
he could even go past a black hole.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.150
It's hard to tell when...

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:23.690
It's an event horizon, not log horizon, huh?

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:25.980
How selfish!

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:29.810
Then I will go meet Sir Krusty!

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:30.620
Seriously?

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:33.810
What a dependable Round Table rep!

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:35.400
I see...

00:22:37.230 --> 00:22:38.770
Shiroe?

00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:41.150
He must've thought of something.

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:15.600
One day, Minori and the others find two girls.

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:19.600
They are the child-guardians,
Izumo's useless sisters.

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:22.850
They are the Mofur sisters, Lelia and Litka.

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:25.690
It seems they have previous ties
with Shiroe and the others.

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:30.060
Are they going to be
Log Horizon's pets? Hm?

00:24:30.060 --> 00:24:32.310
